  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 遊子ê心聲"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">遊子ê心聲</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 阿墨</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjvNkl-pvIHn_skNApCcd5SpgSmrNd6QqsX6BjcOBBSFlUrVV1Mw6f2ab_pBi0-2V3KhHChX8EU0jfQEaJ8VsrIMh2wcaGjiu_Qc7uqDywiQ7kTUz9n1iwUK435M7lCn68ySOOA6bn7TVnAmWT7UiVbZRMs4vnec-e7iwmmlmOkDWCRAXygHUNpYBF5rxNt\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        群影映秋水<br>一飛沖天連碧天<br>雲遊四海無終止<br>無厝ê孤兒tâm目墘<br>離鄉拍拚ê鄉愁滿喉tīnn<br><br>點起心湖ê相思<br>隨風寄付南方去<br>夢中滾絞ê聲音已經響起<br>田kap仔ê聲　聲聲遲<br>火金蛄滿山sì-kè是<br>故鄉--啊　我是不得已<br>離開你是為著五斗米<br>請你諒解遊子ê哀悲<br><br>夕妝紅雲起<br>清風拂面迷人醉<br>金縷射破白霧茫煙離<br>窗外一幕幕夜色ê草仔青<br>一步一步踏入思念ê印記<br><br>客運車ê司機<br>小小拜託一mí-lih<br>歸心似箭ê希望全靠--你<br>Beh走beh飛mài躊躇<br>面前浮起團圓時<br>\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgrm6ZrdT5D8cflnpKmgHArGS0i18gGMCfvYYOsQMYGvcJypk1DuKCJivLqjHRGImdLb5ok0zOyYQ0XLnzH6r_G8NfxaWn6ZufUqqOeS-EbS8chAht4mDWlWriAGBrW82gaiMEedl4j-WOqytl6Wlu2ciuhbXZt4BHNegdW9-6bYUul5M-zGOtEPKCL73sK\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 390期，2026年09月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
